  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help Us Scratch those Fleas!</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In 2018 we rescued over 800 street dogs from a desperate situation.  Most of them are still in our large refuges.  We have no government funding, relying on donations and grants to care for the animal care.  This year the summer in Morocco was long and dry and our refuges have no access to mains water.  With the drought we struggled to deliver enough water to keep the dogs hydrated.  We did not have enough to wash the dogs and disinfect the ground.... and now we have a plague of ticks and fleas.</narrative>
  </description>
